OL,3,GNEWSACycling accident 'blackspot' that
OL,4,Aleft man in coma fixed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn uneven section of a cycle path named
OL,7,Fan "accident blackspot" - after one man
OL,8,Fsuffered a brain haemorrhage in a crash
OL,9,Fand others reported sustaining injuries
OL,10,Fincluding a broken jaw - has been
OL,11,Fresurfaced.
OL,13,FThe repairs come less than a week after
OL,14,Fthe BBC reported on accidents on the
OL,15,FBristol and Bath Railway Path at Siston
OL,16,FCommon near Warmley.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34102
