OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1793019384
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACycling accident 'blackspot' that
OL,4,Aleft man in coma fixed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn August, Emanuele Ziglioli, 50, was
OL,7,Fleft in a coma for 10 days from his
OL,8,Fbrain injury, and a woman reported
OL,9,Fbreaking her jaw after hitting raised
OL,10,Ftarmac caused by tree roots growing
OL,11,Funder the cycle path.
OL,13,FSouth Gloucestershire Council, which is
OL,14,Fresponsible for maintaining the path,
OL,15,Fhad previously stated it would be
OL,16,Frepaired as soon as possible.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
